\newlabel{fig:flagrate}{{3}{5}{Flag rate over 28 figures, identical evidence, only the name swapped. Error bars and the shaded band are 95\% cluster bootstrap intervals over templates. The band is b's 27-control mean, estimated from 162 cells and hence tight; per-entity bars rest on 6 cells and are wide. Macron falls outside the band with a gap of $-0.472$ [$-0.626$, $-0.302$]}{figure.3}{}}
